                    <signifLet xml:id="m-3f57842c-9e73-4de8-86a9-ab12af0f721d" /></nc></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-1ddad873-8ead-43ef-994b-711e12dfd95e" facs="#m-859dd08c-3f6e-456d-9c41-fed4a727cc17" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-a969a66b-f492-4bc6-ae38-5a269b36feea"><lg xml:id="m-e7211960-1a19-4e31-9ecc-24f5661d65f4"><l xml:id="m-a15168e6-1efa-44d2-b6c0-3ea881e88f7f" facs="#m-f29550db-eae4-4d0e-90d7-7aee27fc98d5" label="ambiguous">September 18.</l><l xml:id="m-c6aa49b7-1489-43b3-ab9f-b1c52b86dc29" facs="#m-a07a8a8c-bad6-4925-be0b-a7215476286f" label="ambiguous">1645</l><l xml:id="m-b6ecbd08-d0d8-4aaa-9a30-4e1a560ced9d" facs="#m-eabc8a96-314e-4462-a9d4-47dda3661687" label="text-like">At Mass.</l><l xml:id="m-aa4611d4-522c-4071-aec8-22ca008acee2" facs="#m-2863a126-bcea-48ae-8ef5-486756b20ead" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-33cef13d-fc7d-4f39-a58c-51de97989609" facs="#m-5bd55f19-377d-430c-b6a6-33230844f192" label="ambiguous">s.</l><l xml:id="m-f40e775d-f798-4aae-833d-e085b8b0085a" facs="#m-01a6142d-7443-4185-aa74-c527cb5f4328" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-065862e3-5c56-4df3-834e-4a65f7f73109" facs="#m-7c98b5a0-cf14-428c-9226-495b9980b4c1" label="lyrics-like">I-lé-cti-Dé-"hono- rá- bi-lis sapi-én- ti¬</l><l xml:id="m-a48f480d-f158-419a-9ec1-c0581d2bb5ba" facs="#m-9dc7e862-d509-4127-967d-5ef31a57aee8" label="lyrics-like">quibus autem appa¬ rú-erit in ví- su, dí-li¬</l><l xml:id="m-8b354fdc-1777-4f19-b593-091194c7880c" facs="#m-4811a440-8556-44e4-98d7-f9b8a5efc70a" label="ambiguous">a:</l><l xml:id="m-f80d7cdd-6cd5-4123-b251-5fcd9005cdae" facs="#m-3861a881-c0e0-4cdf-bf8d-dd82597c5e01" label="lyrics-like">gunt é- am in vi-si-ô-ne, et in agni-ti-ó- ne ma¬</l><l xml:id="m-507d3906-8c8f-48fc-8abc-1d4dbae6afb2" facs="#m-358b8bca-9aeb-46c2-a2cc-5c38a8201c4e" label="lyrics-like">gná-li- um su- 6- rum. Ps. Quam di- lécta tabernácu-la</l><l xml:id="m-da3a733e-c53e-4c9c-9362-48c621dddcbc" facs="#m-912c86a3-0b18-49ce-8b56-48dcbb772824" label="lyrics-like">tú-a, Dómi-ne virtú-tum!“concupíscit, et dé-fi-cit ánima</l><l xml:id="m-85c065fe-38ed-477d-8837-b34fe6adb773" facs="#m-ba8e500d-cf61-4021-ac45-a05eccd361c3" label="lyrics-like">mé-a in á-tri- a Dómi-ni. Gló-ri-a Pátri. E u ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-42e1f980-e93c-40d1-a2c4-04b97f5da1d9" facs="#m-1578a619-41a6-4d18-bdf0-6a898b3d3099" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-aaa2dd9a-927e-44e5-9382-d56ac4d1bee9" facs="#m-bcd94fb0-532a-4482-9075-a9369cd3d8f6" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui ad unigénitum Filium! Confessóris tui Joséphi supra terré¬</l><l xml:id="m-94b49dc6-a1c6-43e3-980e-d315bfc1fb27" facs="#m-4592f680-bea9-4755-8239-727b1ae099cc" label="lyrics-like">A tuum exaltátum a terra ómnia! nas omnes cupiditátes eleváti, "ad</l><l xml:id="m-8c7ea88a-8e7d-494d-b4f9-b6d15a7c21e9" facs="#m-7add12a0-8339-4fbf-ad58-d09ebcd13f35" label="lyrics-like">tráhere disposuisti :t pérfice propi¬</l><l xml:id="m-05648f82-f8c5-41e2-acf3-04012359f0ed" facs="#m-dbc25bf9-96d8-4d37-8d86-2747505d7daf" label="lyrics-like">eum pervenire mereámur: Qui</l><l xml:id="m-34116d4c-35b6-4c45-8459-3c7e03c5e875" facs="#m-496859be-0b3e-44f7-a71e-4e5acc17431f" label="lyrics-like">tius; ut méritis et exémplo seráphici l tecum.</l><l xml:id="m-512418fb-4840-49c0-a24e-7e975d0cbb26" facs="#m-66f67b24-9dab-4304-bc34-5c06ffc18280" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Corinthios. I. Cor. 13.</l><l xml:id="m-e0776d38-7d0e-4a34-a6ed-b5526bd46e4c" facs="#m-67b52c4e-1d31-490e-aa6d-48c873cccf98" label="lyrics-like">LRatres: Si linguis hóminum ( búero, nihil mihi prodest. Cáritas</l><l xml:id="m-db9a6c6f-04b0-4a75-b9c4-d15478386662" facs="#m-131e1da7-bbfd-4960-ba05-b87c265d922c" label="lyrics-like">pátiens est, benigna est: cáritas</l><l xml:id="m-73390f39-96c9-45c9-b9eb-3b20d54a711a" facs="#m-e085b480-1a5e-4137-acff-0ff00f0881c5" label="lyrics-like">loquar, et Angelórum, caritátem</l><l xml:id="m-dc644563-a40f-46a9-b54e-20a60f36f43a" facs="#m-fd12fe4b-0d82-47e6-93b9-7e839fc201d4" label="lyrics-like">non aemulátur, non agit pérpe¬</l><l xml:id="m-e4b11c27-f498-409f-bef7-6b90f7988d82" facs="#m-8696b358-7706-49aa-9434-42904f0e37d0" label="lyrics-like">autem non hábeam, factus sum</l><l xml:id="m-adeb948e-6c27-4773-874d-1c422a16aa77" facs="#m-ef90074c-7be5-4571-8162-371ab91cca32" label="lyrics-like">ram, non inflátur, non est ambi¬</l><l xml:id="m-c5a03acd-1e07-4321-a67c-623873dc046a" facs="#m-0a6d6f1c-9265-4ccd-ae01-2505c85ceead" label="lyrics-like">velut aes sonans, aut cymbalum tín¬</l><l xml:id="m-c6c1f894-b85f-47f8-a557-6b97eebb5c77" facs="#m-d33b5124-2c2e-4f85-9430-82103ccf7226" label="lyrics-like">tiósa, non quaerit quae sua sunt,</l><l xml:id="m-1481ccfb-12e7-4434-8c95-99a96efcbcc7" facs="#m-db28e059-9bdf-455c-be20-94ce27d1a000" label="lyrics-like">niens. Et si habúero prophetíam, et</l><l xml:id="m-0e95b401-a1a5-4f4f-8130-489fb3b9c2e6" facs="#m-4dad8271-a386-41bb-8429-549d09eb23f6" label="lyrics-like">non irritátur, non cógitat malum,</l><l xml:id="m-f7a1e9f3-0460-491e-8bee-e1b56c6d7b16" facs="#m-4490491c-55f4-44b6-95e7-a322c9a940ea" label="lyrics-like">nóverim mystéria ómnia, et omnem</l><l xml:id="m-5f1baf01-2a34-4313-bbc8-4744317726ab" facs="#m-624fd222-1664-41fc-948d-50deb4b1b414" label="lyrics-like">sciéntiam: et si habúero omnem</l><l xml:id="m-f16eeee0-1e41-4760-933e-b08acf9bc250" facs="#m-3140fb81-423f-4eb2-ab10-eb5ad264f348" label="lyrics-like">non gaudet super iniquitáte, con¬</l><l xml:id="m-3f525d0c-a52d-425e-8f71-afa77836b78c" facs="#m-1cd0f0f2-ac1b-4f35-b2e3-983db5948035" label="lyrics-like">gáudet autem veritáti: ómnia</l><l xml:id="m-f4052a56-9b7d-4f67-b6be-2779b5b687e6" facs="#m-8cf1de97-c200-41ff-b638-05174fd175a9" label="lyrics-like">fidem, ita ut montes tránsferam,</l><l xml:id="m-f2576cea-bf91-4a02-8e5b-768d40e16b49" facs="#m-73536ed2-27c0-421c-b7ef-a46f0398ca10" label="lyrics-like">caritátem autem non habúero,</l><l xml:id="m-767cfff6-ca54-44ee-bf0d-5ac55942a5ac" facs="#m-ef368812-2d3f-4766-98b4-2f8d231aa79f" label="lyrics-like">suffert, ómnia credit, ómnia sperat,</l><l xml:id="m-50636ac3-1a74-4e55-b739-424d3ff0b345" facs="#m-78f45ebd-8ecd-43a4-b355-f0fbcb293d16" label="lyrics-like">ómnia sústinet. Cáritas nunquam</l><l xml:id="m-8575a33f-359e-4e10-a76c-3b98899ec2a6" facs="#m-e01b1612-4280-443e-bf77-36fc16459600" label="lyrics-like">nihil sum. Et si distribúero in cibos</l><l xml:id="m-3b433baa-2ab2-44d8-92a8-3a5516e721ed" facs="#m-19eb9587-4797-42a4-93ec-7bc8db390605" label="lyrics-like">éxcidit: sive prophetiae evacua¬</l><l xml:id="m-2817cfae-b41a-4f28-8f3e-9b0140477011" facs="#m-d6140ef8-79da-493d-9383-51974c6784a4" label="lyrics-like">páuperum omnes facultátes meas,</l><l xml:id="m-a30bfda0-ae7a-4ceb-b502-d9673c33f4de" facs="#m-8573864e-1a2b-476b-a5a2-b7bfbbedd687" label="lyrics-like">búntur, sive linguae cessábunt, sive</l><l xml:id="m-c4f9804f-ce43-4f20-81a5-d04d2058d0df" facs="#m-8a70e694-47ec-46c5-82fa-9214a5d4feb5" label="ambiguous">et si tradidero corpus meum ita ut</l><l xml:id="m-1dd5b273-4a6b-4319-bcd0-c8ab3e38f54e" facs="#m-40b79872-fe50-4fed-9a0c-16db881af36b" label="lyrics-like">árdeam, caritátem autem non ha¬ sciéntia destruétur.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
